NativeSupporterVault / concrete vault accounting views
├── Given invalid bucket or unknown/closed position
│   └── It rejects aliasing rather than returning another claim
├── Given malformed abstract-adapter zero denominator
│   └── Defensive base invariant rejects invalid math (test-only negative-control adapter)
├── Given canonical successful zero numerator versus reverted getter
│   └── It distinguishes economic impairment from unavailable valuation
└── Given usable canonical totals
    └── It exposes raw native-unit B/Q, deficit, ceil reserve, carry and normal/fixed payout previews
